<title>MEXICO: Radio Centro 9-months net falls.</title>
<headline>Radio Centro 9-months net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income     26.47 million		17.93 million</p>
<p>	Integ Fin Cost  7.52 million		 15.29 million</p>
<p>	Net		 7.63 million		 33.86 million</p>
